// Package lucide holds the few Lucide icons that examples/llms/settings
// and the code blocks of docs/llms.txt use, as tela.Icon variables
// generated by `tela icons gen` from the SVG files in this directory. It is
// a subset of the separate module github.com/kuronosu/tela/icons/lucide,
// with the same names (the core module cannot import that module), so the
// example reads as an app that imports the real set: docs/llms.txt shows it
// with that import path. The drawings are lucide-static 1.61.0's, under
// Lucide's license (LICENSE).
//
// To change the set, add or remove SVG files here and run
//
//	go generate ./examples/llms/settings/lucide
//
//go:generate go run github.com/kuronosu/tela/cmd/tela icons gen -pkg lucide -o . -source "Lucide 1.61.0 (lucide-static, https://lucide.dev)" -license ISC -license-file LICENSE .
package lucide
